sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title HackMatch — US-012: Create and Manage a Team Recruitment Listing — Event-Free Team Creation Sequence
    actor User as Participant
    participant ReactUI
    participant FirebaseAuth
    participant ExpressAPI
    participant TeamService
    participant PostgreSQL

    User->>ReactUI: Enter team, pitch, goal, hours, link, size, and vacancy drafts
    ReactUI->>ReactUI: Validate fields with no event selector
    alt Client validation fails
        ReactUI-->>User: Field errors with entered values preserved
    else Client validation succeeds
        ReactUI->>ExpressAPI: POST /api/teams without eventId
        ExpressAPI->>FirebaseAuth: Verify token, MFA, active account, PART role, and verified email
        alt Authentication or validation fails
            ExpressAPI-->>ReactUI: 400, 401, or 403 with explicit code
            ReactUI-->>User: Preserve form and show failure
        else Eligible verified PART
            ExpressAPI->>TeamService: Create team for authenticated participant
            TeamService->>PostgreSQL: Create Internal Shadow Event with default capacity 4
            PostgreSQL-->>TeamService: Backend shadow event_id
            TeamService->>PostgreSQL: RPC create_team_with_owner
            PostgreSQL->>PostgreSQL: Lock participant and shadow event
            PostgreSQL->>PostgreSQL: Insert Open team and Confirmed Owner membership
            PostgreSQL->>PostgreSQL: Clear owner LFT and cancel same-shadow pending requests
            PostgreSQL-->>TeamService: Team and owner membership
            TeamService-->>ExpressAPI: Created team
            ExpressAPI->>PostgreSQL: Read allow-listed TeamView
            ExpressAPI-->>ReactUI: 201 created
            loop Each initial vacancy draft
                ReactUI->>ExpressAPI: POST /api/teams/:teamId/vacancies
                ExpressAPI->>PostgreSQL: Owner-guarded capacity-checked RPC
                PostgreSQL-->>ExpressAPI: Updated vacancy state or explicit failure
                ExpressAPI-->>ReactUI: Updated TeamView or error
            end
            ReactUI-->>User: Open created team workspace
        end
    end

    Note over TeamService,PostgreSQL: Shadow-event insertion and create_team_with_owner are separate calls. A failed RPC can leave an unused internal event row.
    Note over ReactUI,ExpressAPI: Initial vacancies are added after team creation. The current UI logs an individual slot failure and still completes the team flow.

